{"abstract":"Beyond being used as fast and cheap annotators for otherwise complex classification tasks, LLMs have seen a growing adoption for generating synthetic data for social science and design research. Researchers have used LLM-generated data for data augmentation and prototyping, as well as for direct analysis where LLMs acted as proxies for real human subjects. LLM-based synthetic data build on fundamentally different epistemological assumptions than previous synthetically generated data and are justified by a different set of considerations. In this essay, we explore the various ways in which LLMs have been used to generate research data and consider the underlying epistemological (and accompanying methodological) assumptions. We challenge some of the assumptions made about LLM-generated data, and we highlight the main challenges that social sciences and humanities need to address if they want to adopt LLMs as synthetic data generators.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Rossi, Luca","Harrison, Katherine","Shklovski, Irina"],"cuid":["S02-091.43-804395"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Linköping University"],"keyword":["LLM","Research methods","Social science","Synthetic data"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the problems of llm generated data in social science research","src":["itu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.6092/issn.1971-8853/19576","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work was partially supported by the Wallenberg AI, Autonomous Systems and Soft-ware Program – Humanity and Society (WASP-HS) funded by the Marianne and Marcus Wallenberg Foundation."],"id":"S02-091.43-804395","identifier":[{"id":"85216275707","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-bbaa564a-5dd3-4453-9db4-4ab906bd4abc","ku-58c67b46-719a-454a-809e-937e2eb0fa87"],"keyword":["LLM","research methods","social science","synthetic data"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-8459890C2A0921CCDEB03E5D5E4A69C2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://sociologica.unibo.it/article/view/19576/18669","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/448370172/19576-rossi.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.6092/issn.1971-8853/19576","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science, NEtwoRks, Data, and Society","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, Human-Centered Data Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"se","key":"linköping university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Linköping University","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Communication","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science, Human-Centred Computing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Luca","key":"rossipau","last":"Rossi","locid":"1b45e3f5-b8cd-4c0d-a444-2901304f76ee","name":"Rossi, Luca","orcid":"0000-0002-3629-2039","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Katherine","key":"harrisonpau","last":"Harrison","name":"Harrison, Katherine","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Irina","key":"shklovskipau","last":"Shklovski","locid":"e5067505-4088-4c76-b398-aedd455ed164","name":"Shklovski, Irina","orcid":"0000-0003-1874-0958","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.6092/issn.1971-8853/19576","issn":["19718853"],"issue":"2","journal":"Sociologica","pages":"145-168","status":"p","title":"Sociologica","title_org":"Sociologica - International Journal for Sociological Debate","volume":"18"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85216275707"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-bbaa564a-5dd3-4453-9db4-4ab906bd4abc","ku-58c67b46-719a-454a-809e-937e2eb0fa87"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"The Problems of LLM-generated Data in Social Science Research","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-091.43-804395","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"The evidence- and consensus-based guideline on atopic eczema, published in JEADV on 18 August 2022 (part 1) and 3 September 2022 (part 2) was developed in accordance with the EuroGuiDerm Guideline and Consensus Statement Development Manual. Four consensus conferences were held between December 2020 and July 2021. Twenty-nine experts (including clinicians and patient representatives) from 12 European countries participated. To reflect the most recent evidence on novel systemic medications, an update was published in October 2022. According to the purpose of the Italian Society of Dermatology and STD (SIDEMAST), the Italian Association of Hospital Dermatologists (ADOI) and the Italian Society of Allergological and Environmental Dermatology (SIDAPA) to adapt the EuroGuiDerm guideline on the treatment of atopic eczema into the Italian Healthcare setting, the original update has been supplemented by inserting notes, well highlighted by the original text, to emphasize the laws, rules, procedures and suggestions of the Italian Ministry of Health and regional Health authorities.","author_count":47,"contributors":["Argenziano, Giuseppe","Cusano, Francesco","Corazza, Monica","Amato, Salvatore","Amerio, Paolo","Naldi, Luigi","Patruno, Cataldo","Pigatto, Paolo D.","Quaglino, Pietro","Gisondi, Paolo","Chiricozzi, Andrea","Tonon, Francesco","Stingeni, Luca","Calzavara-Pinton, Piergiacomo","Wollenberg, Andreas","Kinberger, Maria","Arents, Bernd W.","Aszodi, Nora","Avila Valle, Gabriela L.","Barbarot, Sebastien","Bieber, Thomas","Brough, Helen A.","Christen-Zäch, Stéphanie","Deleuran, Mette","Dittmann, Martin","Dressler, Corinna","Fink-Wagner, Antjie H.","Fosse, Nicole","Gáspár, Krisztián","Gerbens, Louise A.","Gieler, Uwe","Girolomoni, Giampiero","Gregoriou, Stamatios","Mortz, Charlotte G.","Nast, Alexander","Nygaard, Uffe","Redding, Magali","Rehbinder, Eva M.","Ring, Johannes","Rossi, Mariateresa","Serra-Baldrich, Esther","Simon, Dagmar","Szala I, Zsuzsanna Z.","Szepietowski, Jacek C.","Torrelo, Antonio","Werfel, Thomas","Flohr, Carsten"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-741931"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Calzavara-Pinton, Piergiacomo"],"country":["Austria","Belgium","France","Germany","Greece","Hungary","Italy","Netherlands","Norway","Poland","Slovakia","Spain","Switzerland","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["ARNAS Ospedali Civico Di Cristina Benfratelli","ARNAS-Palermo","All Global Affiliations","Azienda Ospedaliera G. Rummo","Azienda Ospedaliera Spedali Civili di Brescia","Bonn University Hospital","Brescia Civil Hospital","CHU Nantes","Catholic University in Ruzomberok","Charité - University Medicine Berlin","Charité-Universitätsmedizin Berlin","European Federation of Allergy and Airways Diseases Patients' Associations","Fondazione Policlinico Universitario Agostino Gemelli IRCCS","Fondazione Policlinico Universitario Gemelli","G. Rummo Hospital","Gabriele dAnnunzio University","Global Allergy and Airways Diseases Patient Platform (GAAPP)","Global Allergy and Airways Patient Platform","Graduate School of Health Economics and Management","Guy's and St Thomas' NHS Foundation Trust","Hannover Medical School","Heim Pal Children's Hospital","Heim Pál National Children's Institute Budapest","Hospital Infantil Niño Jesús","Hospital Infantil Universitario Nino Jesus de Madrid","Hospital de la Santa Creu in Sant Pau","Hospital of Santa Creu i Sant Pau","Justus Liebig University Giessen","King's College London","Lausanne University Hospital","Ludwig Maximilian University","Ludwig-Maximilian University of Munich","Magna Græcia University","National Institute for Nuclear Physics","National and Kapodistrian University of Athens","Oslo University Hospital","Ospedale San Bortolo","Rector of the University of Brescia","San Bortolo Hospital Of Vicenza","Second University of Naples","St. Antonius Ziekenhuis","Technical University of Munich","University \"Magna Græcia\" of Catanzaro","University Hospital Basel","University Hospital Bonn","University Hospital Brussel","University Hospital of Basel","University Hospital of Bern","University Hospital of Nantes","University of Amsterdam","University of Athens","University of Bern","University of Brescia","University of Chieti-Pescara","University of Debrecen","University of Ferrara","University of Lausanne","University of Milan","University of Naples Federico II","University of Perugia","University of Torino Medical School","University of Turin","University of Verona","Vrije Universiteit Brussel","Wroclaw Medical University","Wrocław Medical University"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"italian s000000000003 guideline on the treatment of atopic eczema first update adapted from euroguiderm by the italian society of dermatology and std sidemast the italian association of hospital dermatologists adoi and the italian society of allergological and occupational dermatology sidapa","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.23736/S2784-8671.24.07667-9","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-741931","identifier":[{"id":"38727635","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85194976827","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-8c5a57d4-6fb0-45a3-90bc-fa1e5e9bf12c","sdu-92f853cf-09b6-4524-a1ef-348f81272d90"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8D804CA2C0A3B8019368AEAD21E87E67"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.23736/S2784-8671