{"abstract":"Multiplex social networks are characterized by a common set of actors connected through multiple types of relations. The multinet package provides a set of R functions to analyze multiplex social networks within the more general framework of multilayer networks, where each type of relation is represented as a layer in the network. The package contains functions to import/export, create and manipulate multilayer networks, implementations of several state-of-the-art multiplex network analysis algorithms, e.g., for centrality measures, layer comparison, community detection and visualization. Internally, the package is mainly written in native C++ and integrated with R using the Rcpp package.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Magnani, Matteo","Rossi, Luca","Vega, Davide"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384187"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Uppsala University"],"keyword":["Multilayer","Multiplex","Networks","Social network analysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"analysis of multiplex social networks with r","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.18637/jss.v098.i08","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384187","identifier":[{"id":"85108233585","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-c6f90580-9794-41e4-9e3c-09365a7121ba"],"keyword":["multilayer","multiplex","networks","social network analysis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-0B15E21BCB81E17DBEAD54BDC84890BD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"C