ristina","orcid":"0000-0003-0450-2983","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jesper","key":"henrichsenpau","last":"Henrichsen","name":"Henrichsen, Jesper","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lucas","key":"beckpau","last":"Beck","name":"Beck, Lucas","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-ad5e1f8a-8208-4a7a-9eda-4c7de8836440"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Measuring Violence : A Computational Analysis of Violence and Propagation of Image Tweets From Political Protest","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-497004","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Digital technologies present new methodological and ethical challenges for migration studies: from ensuring data access in ethically viable ways to privacy protection, ensuring autonomy, and security of research participants. This Introductory chapter argues that the growing field of digital migration research requires new modes of caring for (big) data. Besides from methodological and ethical reflexivity such care work implies the establishing of analytically sustainable and viable environments for the respective data sets—from large-scale data sets (“big data”) to ethnographic materials. Further, it is argued that approaching migrants’ digital data “with care” means pursuing a critical approach to the use of big data in migration research where the data is not an unquestionable proxy for social activity but rather a complex construct of which the underlying social practices (and vulnerabilities) need to be fully understood. Finally, it is presented how the contributions of this book offer an in-depth analysis of the most crucial methodological and ethical challenges in digital migration studies and reflect on ways to move this field forward.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Sandberg, Marie","Rossi, Luca"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-526454"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"caring for big data an introduction to research methodologies and ethical challenges in digital migration studies","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-81226-3_1","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-526454","ids":["ku-deab9419-b963-47d0-8917-7cc892b26db3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-961FC66CB582BD8AE0F57073E2899CAD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-81226-3_1","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, SAXO-Institute - Archaeology, Ethnology, Greek & Latin, History"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Marie","key":"sandbergpau","last":"Sandberg","locid":"556598fb-c2f2-4f52-875f-47c31eaea1b0","name":"Sandberg, Marie","orcid":"0000-0001-7831-3419","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Luca","key":"rossipau","last":"Rossi","name":"Rossi, Luca","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Marie","key":"sandbergpedh","last":"Sandberg","name":"Sandberg, Marie","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Luca","key":"rossipedh","last":"Rossi","name":"Rossi, Luca","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Vasilis","key":"galispedh","last":"Galis","name":"Galis, Vasilis","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Martin Bak","key":"jørgensenpedh","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Martin Bak","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-81226-3_1","eisbn":["9783030812263"],"isbn":["9783030812256"],"pages":"1-21","place":"Switzerland","publisher":"Palgrave Macmillan","status":"p","title":"Research methodologies and ethical challenges in digital migration studies: Caring for (big) data"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-deab9419-b963-47d0-8917-7cc892b26db3"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Caring for (Big) Data : An Introduction to Research Methodologies and Ethical Challenges in Digital Migration Studies","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-526454","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"author_count":4,"contributors":["Makrygianni, Vasiliki","Kamal, Ahmad","Rossi, Luca","Galis, Vasilis"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384909"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"migrant digital space building an incomplete map to navigate public online migration","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-81226-3","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384909","ids":["itu-f719fcab-6614-463a-9472-9044406da970"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-6-9-965E2AA65ECD1C1A8EA933E2E4E62E3D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-81226-3","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Vasiliki","key":"makrygiannipau","last":"Makrygianni","name":"Makrygianni, Vasiliki","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ahmad","key":"kamalpau","last":"Kamal","name":"Kamal, Ahmad","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Luca","key":"rossipau","last":"Rossi","locid":"1b45e3f5-b8cd-4c0d-a444-2901304f76ee","name":"Rossi, Luca","orcid":"0000-0002-3629-2039","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"fi