ank":34,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anand","key":"devarajpau","last":"Devaraj","name":"Devaraj, Anand","rank":35,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Zaigham","key":"saghirpau","last":"Saghir","locid":"0e163ed1-b256-4876-be5d-b75adbfe7183","name":"Saghir, Zaigham","orcid":"0000-0002-2693-8617","rank":36,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Giuseppe","key":"pelosipau","last":"Pelosi","name":"Pelosi, Giuseppe","rank":37,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["32599792"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3390/cancers12061672","issn":["20726694"],"issue":"6","journal":"Cancers","paperid":"1672","status":"p","title":"Cancers","volume":"12"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85087083451"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-3cd8eeb2-6339-48a3-9d72-2020f15c3bca"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Recommendations for Implementing Lung Cancer Screening with Low-Dose Computed Tomography in Europe","type":"Journal Review","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-429799","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Chronic lymphocytic leukemia (CLL) is a disease of the elderly, characterized by immunodeficiency. Hence, patients with CLL might be considered more susceptible to severe complications from COVID-19. We undertook this retrospective international multicenter study to characterize the course of COVID-19 in patients with CLL and identify potential predictors of outcome. Of 190 patients with CLL and confirmed COVID-19 diagnosed between 28/03/2020 and 22/05/2020, 151 (79%) presented with severe COVID-19 (need of oxygen and/or intensive care admission). Severe COVID-19 was associated with more advanced age (≥65 years) (odds ratio 3.72 [95% CI 1.79–7.71]). Only 60 patients (39.7%) with severe COVID-19 were receiving or had recent (≤12 months) treatment for CLL at the time of COVID-19 versus 30/39 (76.9%) patients with mild disease. Hospitalization rate for severe COVID-19 was lower (p < 0.05) for patients on ibrutinib versus those on other regimens or off treatment. Of 151 patients with severe disease, 55 (36.4%) succumbed versus only 1/38 (2.6%) with mild disease; age and comorbidities did not impact on mortality. In CLL, (1) COVID-19 severity increases with age; (2) antileukemic treatment (particularly BTK inhibitors) appears to exert a protective effect; (3) age and comorbidities did not impact on mortality, alluding to a relevant role of CLL and immunodeficiency.","author_count":82,"contributors":["Scarfò, Lydia","Chatzikonstantinou, Thomas","Rigolin, Gian Matteo","Quaresmini, Giulia","Motta, Marina","Vitale, Candida","Garcia-Marco, Jose Antonio","Hernández-Rivas, José Ángel","Mirás, Fatima","Baile, Mónica","Marquet, Juan","Niemann, Carsten Utoft","Reda, Gianluigi","Munir, Talha","Gimeno, Eva","Marchetti, Monia","Quaglia, Francesca Maria","Varettoni, Marzia","Delgado, Julio","Iyengar, Sunil","Janssens, Ann","Marasca, Roberto","Ferrari, Angela","Cuéllar-García, Carolina","Itchaki, Gilad","Špaček, Martin","De Paoli, Lorenzo","Laurenti, Luca","Levin, Mark David","Lista, Enrico","Mauro, Francesca R.","Šimkovič, Martin","Van Der Spek, Ellen","Vandenberghe, Elisabeth","Trentin, Livio","Wasik-Szczepanek, Ewa","Ruchlemer, Rosa","Bron, Dominique","De Paolis, Maria Rosaria","Del Poeta, Giovanni","Farina, Lucia","Foglietta, Myriam","Gentile, Massimo","Herishanu, Yair","Herold, Tobias","Jaksic, Ozren","Kater, Arnon P.","Kersting, Sabina","Malerba, Lara","Orsucci, Lorella","Popov, Viola Maria","Sportoletti, Paolo","Yassin, Mohamed","Pocali, Barbara","Barna, Gabor","Chiarenza, Annalisa","dos Santos, Gimena","Nikitin, Eugene","Andres, Martin","Dimou, Maria","Doubek, Michael","Enrico, Alicia","Hakobyan, Yervand","Kalashnikova, Olga","Ortiz Pareja, Macarena","Papaioannou, Maria","Rossi, Davide","Shah, Nimish","Shrestha, Amit","Stanca, Oana","Stavroyianni, Niki","Strugov, Vladimir","Tam, Constantine","Zdrenghea, Mihnea","Coscia, Marta","Stamatopoulos, Kostas","Rossi, Giuseppe","Rambaldi, Alessandro","Montserrat, Emili’","Foà, Robin","Cuneo, Antonio","Ghia, Paolo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-476782"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, South","Asia, Central","Asia, Middle East","Asia, South","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Argentina","Armenia","Australia","Belgium","Croatia","Czechia","Germany","Greece","Hungary","Ireland","Israel","Italy","Nepal","Netherlands","Poland","Qatar","Romania","Russia","Spain","Switzerland","United Kingdom","Uruguay"],"glorg":["AUSL di Reggio Emilia","Academic Medical Centre","Albert Schweitzer Ziekenhuis","All Global Affiliations","Aristotle University of Thessaloniki","Azienda Ospedaliera Santi Antonio e Biagio e Cesare Arrigo","Azienda Ospedaliera di Rilievo Nazionale Antonio Cardarelli","Bari Polyclinic Giovanni XXIII Children’s Hospital","Brescia Civil Hospital","Carlos Haya","Carol Davila University of Medicine and Pharmacy","Center for Research and Technology - Hellas","Charles Universit