{"abstract":"This article examines the principles outlined in the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) in the context of social network data. We provide both a practical guide to GDPR-compliant social network data processing, covering aspects such as data collection, consent, anonymization and data analysis, and a broader discussion of the problems emerging when the general principles on which the regulation is based are instantiated to this research area.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Kotsios, Andrea","Magnani, Matteo","Rossi, Luca","Shklovski, Irina","D'aurelio, Davide Vega"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382391"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Uppsala University"],"keyword":["Anonymization","Consent","Data Collection","GDPR","Social Network Data"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an analysis of the consequences of the general data protection regulation on social network research","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/84843329/1903.03196.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382391","ids":["itu-4b32dc28-1605-4ee0-9fee-3563cf7233a7"],"keyword":["Anonymization","Consent","Data Collection","GDPR","Social Network Data"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-C075E480F902791F88852FFB1066543C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/84843329/1903.03196.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1903.03196","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[